# Build context exclusions — keeps dev artifacts, VCS data and runtime
# state out of the Docker image. server/data/templates/ and server/data/mibs/
# are intentionally NOT excluded: they are real vendor reference data the
# server needs. Only the seed/runtime data files are excluded.
.git
node_modules
scripts
*.md
agent_dist
opmanager-central-check
server/data/seed.json
server/data/db.json
server/data/opmanager.db
server/data/.admin-initial
*.log
debug_*.png
test_*.png
.DS_Store
